            </note>
            <note corresp="#d540-f2" n="11" xml:id="d540-f2-content">
                <p>See <hi rendition="#italic">Congressional Record</hi>, vol. 83, pt. 1, pp. 249
                    and 1073.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d540-f3" n="12" xml:id="d540-f3-content">
                <p>Joachim von Ribbentrop, appointed Minister for Foreign Affairs of Germany
                    February 4, 1938.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
